              shape: BoxShape.circle,
            ),
            child: Icon(Icons.meeting_room_rounded, size: 20),
          ),
          label: 'Accommodations',
        ),
        BottomNavigationBarItem(
          icon: Icon(Icons.calendar_month_rounded),
          activeIcon: Container(
            padding: EdgeInsets.all(6),
